---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="About Nathan" description="The page where Nathan writes some personal information about himself.">
    <section>
        <article class="content">
            <h1>About me (Nathan!)</h1>
            <p>I'm an Australian software developer travelling the world on a sabbatical, taking a break from the corporate world in an effort to live before I have to settle down, have a family and chill out.</p>
            <p>I've been a professional developer for 8 years now, time flies when you're in and out of sprint ceremonies huh? During my professional tenure,
                I've worked on health technology frontends, enterprise marketing websites, and interactive exam / exam reporting applications.</p>
            <img class="image" src="/images/me_hiking.webp"></img>
            <p>Outside of work though, I love walking, hiking, listening to music, reading and programming some random project I thought up the night before. Travelling the world while doing this has been the biggest privilege of my life. Every week, a new city to explore, new parks to walk, new hills to climb.</p>
        </article>

    </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
.content {
    max-width: 750px;
